{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"A second useful specialization falls straight out of the dependency graph: for every 256-token workload there is only one chunk, so its incoming state is already `initial_states`. Those cases do not need chunk-contribution or boundary-propagation launches at all; a single scan can also write `final_state`. I’m adding that path before deciding the final tile schedule."}}
